    "text": "NYC's only federal jail hosts high-profile detaineesThe city’s only federal jail got another high-profile occupant on Tuesday: Daniel Hernandez, known as the rapper Tekashi 6ix9ine. He joins a long list of high-profile detainees at the Metropolitan Detention Center. From Sean “Diddy” Combs to Luigi Mangione, the facility also now houses the ousted Venezuelan President Nicolás Maduro and his wife. #NY1 #NYC #News #MDC #DetentionCenter ---",
